  "extraction_limitations": [
    "Supplement 1 is a 137-page protocol; extraction was semantically batched around trial objectives, endpoints, eligibility, design, randomization, and statistical analysis rather than atomizing administrative procedures.",
    "Supplement 3 (data-sharing statement) was referenced in the primary article but was not present in the retrieved Drive folder; no details beyond that reference were invented.",
    "The primary PFS efficacy analysis was published previously; this final-OS paper recaps PFS but the atom set emphasizes the final OS, safety, QOL, and biomarker results reported here.",
    "No external clinical-practice or regulatory updates were incorporated into the atom set."
  ],
